{"lines": [{"i": 0, "text": "Your AI agent opens one web page. And burns your whole token budget.", "start": 0.0, "end": 4.656, "words": [{"t": "Your", "s": 0.096166, "e": 0.276457}, {"t": "AI", "s": 0.288458, "e": 0.624999}, {"t": "agent", "s": 0.637, "e": 0.997583}, {"t": "opens", "s": 1.129791, "e": 1.454291}, {"t": "one", "s": 1.466333, "e": 1.7067080000000001}, {"t": "web", "s": 1.71875, "e": 1.935083}, {"t": "page", "s": 1.947125, "e": 2.379833}, {"t": "And", "s": 2.776458, "e": 2.884624}, {"t": "burns", "s": 2.896625, "e": 3.2331659999999998}, {"t": "your", "s": 3.245208, "e": 3.353374}, {"t": "whole", "s": 3.365375, "e": 3.6057499999999996}, {"t": "token", "s": 3.617791, "e": 3.906249}, {"t": "budget", "s": 3.91825, "e": 4.302875}]}, {"i": 1, "text": "Raw HTML. Scripts. Menus. Ads. Thousands of tokens, just to find one button.", "start": 4.936, "end": 11.655999999999999, "words": [{"t": "Raw", "s": 5.032166, "e": 5.260541}, {"t": "HTML", "s": 5.272541, "e": 5.957624}, {"t": "Scripts", "s": 6.35425, "e": 6.8710830000000005}, {"t": "Menus", "s": 7.2677499999999995, "e": 7.7364999999999995}, {"t": "Ads", "s": 8.133125, "e": 8.505708}, {"t": "Thousands", "s": 8.950416, "e": 9.322999000000001}, {"t": "of", "s": 9.335041, "e": 9.419166}, {"t": "tokens", "s": 9.431208, "e": 10.008124}, {"t": "just", "s": 10.212458, "e": 10.380708}, {"t": "to", "s": 10.39275, "e": 10.464875}, {"t": "find", "s": 10.476875, "e": 10.753333}, {"t": "one", "s": 10.765333, "e": 10.933583}, {"t": "button", "s": 10.945625, "e": 11.294166}]}, {"i": 2, "text": "Meet Heron. A browser built for AI agents.", "start": 11.936, "end": 15.32, "words": [{"t": "Meet", "s": 12.032166, "e": 12.200416}, {"t": "Heron", "s": 12.212458, "e": 12.597083}, {"t": "A", "s": 12.993708, "e": 13.065833}, {"t": "browser", "s": 13.077833, "e": 13.462458}, {"t": "built", "s": 13.474458, "e": 13.702833}, {"t": "for", "s": 13.714833, "e": 13.919166}, {"t": "AI", "s": 14.051375, "e": 14.399916000000001}, {"t": "agents", "s": 14.411958, "e": 14.964833}]}, {"i": 3, "text": "It reads the whole page as clean, compact text. A full Wikipedia article, about seven thousand tokens. Nothing cut off.", "start": 15.6, "end": 23.927999999999997, "words": [{"t": "It", "s": 15.696166, "e": 15.852416}, {"t": "reads", "s": 15.864416, "e": 16.068749}, {"t": "the", "s": 16.08075, "e": 16.164875}, {"t": "whole", "s": 16.176916, "e": 16.429332}, {"t": "page", "s": 16.441333, "e": 16.837958}, {"t": "as", "s": 16.85, "e": 16.970208000000003}, {"t": "clean", "s": 16.982208, "e": 17.450958}, {"t": "compact", "s": 17.691333, "e": 18.172083}, {"t": "text", "s": 18.184124999999998, "e": 18.676916}, {"t": "A", "s": 19.073541, "e": 19.133623999999998}, {"t": "full", "s": 19.145666, "e": 19.482207}, {"t": "Wikipedia", "s": 19.49425, "e": 20.095208}, {"t": "article", "s": 20.107208, "e": 20.563958}, {"t": "about", "s": 20.828375, "e": 21.05675}, {"t": "seven", "s": 21.06875, "e": 21.453375}, {"t": "thousand", "s": 21.465375, "e": 21.922125}, {"t": "tokens", "s": 21.934125, "e": 22.450958}, {"t": "Nothing", "s": 22.847583, "e": 23.063916}, {"t": "cut", "s": 23.075958, "e": 23.256249}, {"t": "off", "s": 23.26825, "e": 23.58075}]}, {"i": 4, "text": "Every button and link gets a short ID. Your agent clicks by ID. No guessing selectors.", "start": 24.208, "end": 30.087999999999997, "words": [{"t": "Every", "s": 24.304166, "e": 24.520498999999997}, {"t": "button", "s": 24.5325, "e": 24.881041}, {"t": "and", "s": 24.977249999999998, "e": 25.157541}, {"t": "link", "s": 25.169541, "e": 25.482041}, {"t": "gets", "s": 25.554166, "e": 25.734457}, {"t": "a", "s": 25.746457999999997, "e": 25.782498899999997}, {"t": "short", "s": 25.794541, "e": 26.058957}, {"t": "ID", "s": 26.070999999999998, "e": 26.407541}, {"t": "Your", "s": 26.804166, "e": 26.936373999999997}, {"t": "agent", "s": 26.948375, "e": 27.260875}, {"t": "clicks", "s": 27.272916, "e": 27.561373999999997}, {"t": "by", "s": 27.573375, "e": 27.729625}, {"t": "ID", "s": 27.741666, "e": 28.150332}, {"t": "No", "s": 28.546957999999997, "e": 28.739248999999997}, {"t": "guessing", "s": 28.75125, "e": 29.07575}, {"t": "selectors", "s": 29.087791, "e": 29.724791}]}, {"i": 5, "text": "After each click, Heron sends only what changed. Not the whole page again.", "start": 30.368, "end": 35.096, "words": [{"t": "After", "s": 30.464166, "e": 30.740624}, {"t": "each", "s": 30.752625, "e": 30.920875}, {"t": "click", "s": 30.932916, "e": 31.269457}, {"t": "Heron", "s": 31.63, "e": 31.870375}, {"t": "sends", "s": 31.882416, "e": 32.242999}, {"t": "only", "s": 32.303083, "e": 32.543458}, {"t": "what", "s": 32.555499999999995, "e": 32.723749999999995}, {"t": "changed", "s": 32.735791, "e": 33.288666}, {"t": "Not", "s": 33.685291, "e": 33.829541}, {"t": "the", "s": 33.841541, "e": 33.913666}, {"t": "whole", "s": 33.925708, "e": 34.154083}, {"t": "page", "s": 34.166083, "e": 34.418499}, {"t": "again", "s": 34.430499999999995, "e": 34.730999999999995}]}, {"i": 6, "text": "It runs on Firefox, not Chromium. Plugs into Claude with M C P. And sits behind a Cloudflare gateway, with keys, quotas and usage metering.", "start": 35.376, "end": 44.952, "words": [{"t": "It", "s": 35.472165999999994, "e": 35.60437399999999}, {"t": "runs", "s": 35.616375, "e": 35.832708}, {"t": "on", "s": 35.84475, "e": 35.952915999999995}, {"t": "Firefox", "s": 35.964957999999996, "e": 36.68612399999999}, {"t": "not", "s": 36.854375, "e": 37.046665999999995}, {"t": "Chromium", "s": 37.058707999999996, "e": 37.515457999999995}, {"t": "Plugs", "s": 37.924082999999996, "e": 38.164457999999996}, {"t": "into", "s": 38.1765, "e": 38.33275}, {"t": "Claude", "s": 38.34475, "e": 38.717332999999996}, {"t": "with", "s": 38.729375, "e": 38.885625}, {"t": "M", "s": 38.897625, "e": 39.089915999999995}, {"t": "C", "s": 39.101957999999996, "e": 39.36637399999999}, {"t": "P", "s": 39.378416, "e": 39.726957}, {"t": "And", "s": 40.123582999999996, "e": 40.207708}, {"t": "sits", "s": 40.21975, "e"